WEBVTT

NOTE Unofficial English translation of the Thai narration. If it differs from the Thai original documents, the Thai original prevails.

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:07.041
The Subcommittee on Livestock and
Fisheries Quality and Standards has

00:00:07.041 --> 00:00:12.379
scheduled Meeting No. 21/2569
for Wednesday, 25 November 2026.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:19.480
At 2 p.m., in committee room CA
319, 3rd floor, Parliament House.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:23.100
The subcommittee chair
is Mr. Ruchu Kaewlai.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.934
This subcommittee is part
of the Senate Committee

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:30.438
on Agriculture and Cooperatives.

00:00:30.519 --> 00:00:34.480
The committee chair is
Mr. Sountorn Chaokijka.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:39.760
The committee's three current
subcommittees are chaired as follows.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.420
Livestock and Fisheries:
Mr. Ruchu Kaewlai.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:49.760
Water Management in Farm Areas Outside
Irrigation Zones: Miss Amorn Sribunnak.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:54.180
And Integrated Agricultural
Networks: Mr. Choocheep Auekarn.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:58.677
This meeting was scheduled
by a resolution of

00:00:58.677 --> 00:01:02.018
the subcommittee on
Wednesday, 18 November.

00:01:02.099 --> 00:01:08.036
The agenda has four items: announcements
from the chair, adoption of the minutes

00:01:08.036 --> 00:01:12.859
of Meeting No. 20, matters for
consideration, and other business.

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:16.584
Under matters for
consideration, the meeting will

00:01:16.584 --> 00:01:20.079
consider the subcommittee's
draft study report.

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:25.200
Under other business, it will set the
date and time of its next meeting.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:32.850
At its previous meeting on 18 November,
the subcommittee considered the

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:39.219
draft study report on integrated,
sustainable elimination of rabies.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:43.000
It brainstormed six recommendations.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:48.216
They cover law, integration,
databases, stray-animal

00:01:48.216 --> 00:01:52.858
shelters, public awareness,
and budget support.

00:01:53.859 --> 00:01:57.659
This preview is based on the
subcommittee's meeting notice.

00:01:57.739 --> 00:02:00.654
Meeting results are available
through the channels

00:02:00.654 --> 00:02:02.578
of the Secretariat of the Senate.

